---
import './SellerFees.css';
---

<section class="seller-fees" id="fees">
  <div class="seller-fees-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Clear from the first order</p>
    <h2>Fees you can understand.</h2>
    <p>We keep the seller experience straightforward. You see the service fee before an order is accepted, and your payout is available after the order is complete.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="seller-fees-grid">
    <article class="fee-item">
      <div class="fee-icon">%</div>
      <h3>Marketplace service fee</h3>
      <p>A percentage of the cake subtotal that supports ordering, discovery, and seller tools.</p>
      <strong>From 7%</strong>
      <small>Rates shown are illustrative and subject to your seller agreement.</small>
    </article>
    <article class="fee-item">
      <div class="fee-icon">↗</div>
      <h3>Payment processing</h3>
      <p>A per-order fee for securely processing your customer's payment.</p>
      <strong>2.9% + KES 30</strong>
      <small>Calculated on the order total at checkout.</small>
    </article>
    <article class="fee-item">
      <div class="fee-icon">♥</div>
      <h3>Your delivery, your choice</h3>
      <p>Set collection, delivery, and delivery-zone options that work for your kitchen.</p>
      <strong>You stay in control</strong>
      <small>Delivery charges are shown separately to customers.</small>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
